<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">resonance-lacquer</ansi> (alchemy recipe)

A lacquer that dries to a dull, faintly humming sheen, never quite going
still even long after it has cured hard. Coat a hollow body with it and
sound that enters comes out larger than it went in, thrown far past
anything its size should carry. It smells of resin and something
underneath the resin, a note that never quite finishes ringing.

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Crafting ━━━</ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Skill:</ansi>       alchemy (minimum 50)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Station:</ansi>     alchemy_bench
  <ansi fg="yellow">Ingredients:</ansi> Pine Pitch (x2), Beeswax (x1), Moonpetal (x1)

